      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "赛后星星可改写车辆升级赛道生成与收益规则",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "After each race you can go into the shop and use stars to unlock new vehicles, upgrades, modifications to track generation, the way you earn stars, and more.",
