      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "无限赛道可从窄坡弯路改造成三十车道高速路",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You want to drive narrow roads with a maximum of hills and curves? Or long straight 30-lane highways with no traffic? There are unlimited tracks.",
